    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 4
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Seeker Swarms are clouds of insectoid Collector parasites that immobilize victims by injecting a paralytic compound. They cannot be targeted by conventional weapons and are immune to most attacks — only area effects or special ammo can harm them. A swarm that successfully envelops a target renders that creature Paralyzed until the swarm is driven off.</p>",
